From 3aca114b6647ffa2cbe79f2a019e3479a0e87bbf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ashish Raj Shekhar <ashekha9@asu.edu>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:52:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] oscd_mobile: optional per-point normals seed
 surface-aligned discs (PocketGS I)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

sparse/0/normals.txt (one unit normal per points3D line) makes init_splats start each
Gaussian as a disc tangent to the surface: local z = normal, normal scale = 0.1 × the
tangential 3-NN scale. Absent file or zero normal → the isotropic start as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
